   "widgets_values": [
    "# Offline AI designer\n\nA text model runs **inside ComfyUI** (no internet, no API). Here it is Qwen3-4B, the text encoder that ships with Z-Image Turbo; any text-generation model that **Load CLIP** supports works (pick the matching type).\n\nTakes ~1-2 minutes on a 16 GB GPU. For Claude, use template 06 or the AI Studio tab."
   ],
